Today, we have the pleasure of speaking
with Mad Monkey, woodworker, creator, privacy advocate, and one of the founding voices of the 2140 movement.

4
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:48,000
He builds physical Bitcoin art out of oak,
epoxy, and hard wax oil, sells it on a Bitcoin standard, and carries cyberpunk values into art, music, and culture through the 2140 collective.

