00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:12,000
coffee tables, and limited editions like
Mini Nakamoto.

7
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Beyond the objects, he builds the
platforms and educational space for people to practice free market and sell money culture in real life on Nostra, on Wave Lake, and through 2140.

8
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:36,000
In this conversation, he shares his
journey from maker to Bitcoiner, why wood and resin are the right materials for a money that cannot be printed, what privacy has to do with artistic freedom, and what it looks like to sell culture peer-to-peer on a Bitcoin standard.

